  "releaseNotes": "NativeAOT compatibility and JSON source-generation models; 31-language localization for driver metadata, parameters and logs; instance-prefixed logging; NewLife.XCode dependency upgraded to 12.2.2026.1021-beta0423.  NativeAOT 兼容与 JSON 源生成模型；31 种语言本地化覆盖驱动元数据、参数与日志；实例前缀日志；NewLife.XCode 依赖升级到 12.2.2026.1021-beta0423。",
